OL,3,GNEWSABernard Matthews closure 'a
OL,4,Adevastating blow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a major food factory in
OL,7,FDerby is "a devastating blow", a trade
OL,8,Funion has said.
OL,10,FBernard Matthews Foods said on Thursday
OL,11,Fit would be shutting its processing
OL,12,Ffacility on Shaftesbury Street South by
OL,13,Fthe end of 2026.
OL,15,FAbout 600 jobs are believed to be
OL,16,Faffected by the closure, and the Union
OL,17,Fof Shop, Distributive and Allied
OL,18,FWorkers (Usdaw) said it was offering
OL,19,Fsupport to workers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
