OL,3,GNEWSABernard Matthews closure 'a
OL,4,Adevastating blow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaggy Shanker, the Labour MP for Derby
OL,7,FSouth, said it would be tough for
OL,8,Ffamilies to learn that the company,
OL,9,Ffamous for its turkey farms and
OL,10,Fproducts, would cease operations as
OL,11,Fmany settled down to celebrate
OL,12,FChristmas.
